		(uuid "c50dc39e-8d63-4bcd-88ef-7a2208bc7bba")
	)
	(text "Placement only: no wires or global labels yet. Each anchor gets its\nown DWM3000 (shared symbol, uwb_rescue_locator_shared:DWM3000) plus\nits own decoupling set, per common UWB-transceiver decoupling practice\n(100nF close to VDD1 + 100nF close to VDD3V3 + 1uF bulk on VDD3V3) --\nNOT independently re-verified against the DWM3000 datasheet's own\napplication-circuit figure in this pass (PDF text extraction failed;\nverify against the real Qorvo DWM3000 Data Sheet Rev B app-circuit\ndiagram before fab, same spirit as this repo's other flagged\nPLACEHOLDER/estimate items). SPI/GPIO wiring to the ESP32-S3 on the\nconnectivity sheet and +VSYS/GND from power_bms are both deferred."
		(at 60 38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "23bbac1b-45e3-4c43-a881-d35f6abf7027")
	)
