		(property "Description" "GPIO5 (GPIO5/EXTTXE/SPIPOL, U4 pin 10) SPI-mode-strap pull-down, 10k to GND -- explicitly defines SPI mode 0 (SPIPOL=0/SPIPHA=0) at power-up, per the real Qorvo DWM3000 Data Sheet Rev B 'Sample GPIOs 5&6 to set SPI mode' power-up step (Figures 1/2) and Section 6.3 (see this sheet's note text). Reinforces the DWM3000's own internal 10k-30k pull-down default (Section 6.3) with an explicit external resistor."
